# BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside the Dockerfile.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-exe
**/dist-electron
**/.vite-plus
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.repos
.t3
.plans
.logs
.vercel
.alchemy
release
release-mock
native/**/target
apps/mobile/ios
apps/mobile/android
apps/mobile/.showcase
apps/mobile/.generated
apps/web/.playwright
apps/web/playwright-report
**/__screenshots__
# Never ship secrets or baked origins (VITE_HTTP_URL / VITE_WS_URL / dev auth token).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
.pnpm-store
**/.pnpm-store
